{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "import functools\n\n@functools.lru_cache(maxsize=None)\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    The sequence is defined by a(1) = 1, a(2) = 1, and a(n) = a(a(n-1)) + a(n - a(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        return 1\n    return sequence(sequence(n - 1)) + sequence(n - sequence(n - 1))"}
